WEBVTT

00:03.440 --> 00:04.940
I don't believe it...

00:05.360 --> 00:06.860
Kogarashi, no...

00:08.450 --> 00:10.870
Kogarashi!

00:13.660 --> 00:18.250
In short, Fuyuzora has to see girl's panties,

00:19.210 --> 00:20.380
or he dies.

00:23.710 --> 00:28.800
Uh... Can you give me some context?

00:29.090 --> 00:33.930
Oboro suddenly teleported me
so I don't understand anything, either!

00:34.060 --> 00:37.230
Urakata says that we
need your help, master.

00:37.640 --> 00:38.940
I'm sorry everyone.

00:39.230 --> 00:42.400
Let me briefly summarize the situation.

00:43.730 --> 00:49.200
Today, after class, Hibari and I
were on a mission for the squadron.

00:50.070 --> 00:54.660
Our target was a dangerous ghost, a spellcaster.

00:55.540 --> 00:59.870
We stumbled upon
Fuyuzora, who was working.

01:00.870 --> 01:04.130
And with his last force
just before we eliminated it...

01:05.090 --> 01:08.380
The spectre threw
a powerful spell on him!

01:09.300 --> 01:11.760
I analysed it and the results came out...

01:12.930 --> 01:15.220
That Fuyuzora will die if he doesn't see

01:15.350 --> 01:18.520
12 girl's panties in the next 12 hours!

01:19.100 --> 01:21.350
It's nonsense!

01:22.190 --> 01:27.190
Yuuna and the haunted hot springs

01:27.650 --> 01:32.700
Kogarashi, bewitched!

01:28.400 --> 01:32.610
Then I'll have to show him my panties?

01:32.740 --> 01:33.660
Exactly!

01:33.780 --> 01:35.580
Sorry, Chisaki...

01:35.740 --> 01:39.040
Those dedicated spells I created don't work.

01:39.160 --> 01:43.290
So it must be real.

01:43.750 --> 01:45.380
This spell is so powerful,

01:45.500 --> 01:48.460
that neither me or the Daitengu
have successfully broken it.

01:49.210 --> 01:53.260
Oh my... again? What a risky situation!

01:54.010 --> 01:56.510
I still have progress to make.

01:56.760 --> 02:00.180
Okay, Princess, count on me to help you!

02:00.520 --> 02:02.640
One...Two...Three...

02:02.770 --> 02:05.270
If we need 12, I have to go too.

02:05.400 --> 02:08.650
I'm sorry we sucked on that one!

02:08.780 --> 02:12.240
Kogarashi is always so
vulnerable to magic, huh...

02:13.700 --> 02:16.820
Yet he defeated the black
dragon with a single blow!

02:17.080 --> 02:17.620
Pa...

02:18.660 --> 02:19.450
Kogarashi!

02:19.950 --> 02:21.910
Sorry, girls.

02:23.080 --> 02:25.080
I should have been more careful...

02:25.830 --> 02:28.840
and don't let him approach me...

02:31.010 --> 02:34.510
Don't feel obligated to, please...

02:37.800 --> 02:41.680
The responsibility of the
ninjas of Chuma is engaged!

02:41.810 --> 02:43.640
I will go first!

02:43.770 --> 02:44.980
Sagiri?

02:48.650 --> 02:50.860
So... So Urara...

02:50.940 --> 02:52.110
What does it look like?

02:52.240 --> 02:53.780
Sagiri?

02:54.400 --> 02:55.360
Nothing.

02:55.530 --> 02:56.360
What?

02:56.740 --> 03:00.790
When he sees panties, the skull is supposed to ignite!

03:01.080 --> 03:04.040
And when all 12 flames burn,
the curse will be broken.

03:04.120 --> 03:05.750
That's a ridiculous process!

03:05.870 --> 03:10.170
Fuyuzora's vision is blurred.
You have to show him more closely!

03:21.560 --> 03:24.390
Uhh... like this?

03:26.310 --> 03:29.060
Look, Fuyuzora, panties!

03:30.190 --> 03:32.320
Ameno, you don't need to...

03:32.480 --> 03:35.400
It's really horrible!

03:36.240 --> 03:39.160
That's it, there's a flame! You made it, Sagiri!

03:40.620 --> 03:42.540
We continue, girls!

03:42.790 --> 03:44.790
This spell is ridiculous.

03:45.000 --> 03:47.460
Alright, my turn!

03:47.830 --> 03:51.000
Kogarashi has done so much for me.

03:51.290 --> 03:56.590
If I can help... with my... panties, well...

03:57.180 --> 03:59.390
No! Me first!

03:59.640 --> 04:02.510
No question of bowing
in front of you, Yuna!

04:02.640 --> 04:04.470
If that's the case, me first!

04:04.600 --> 04:05.810
No, me!

04:05.930 --> 04:06.730
You dare?

04:06.890 --> 04:10.060
The order of passage
doesn't matter, first of all!

04:10.190 --> 04:12.190
Then let me!

04:10.190 --> 04:12.190
They're fighting again.

04:12.440 --> 04:15.400
Since that's it, I'm going in.

04:15.650 --> 04:16.400
Yes.

04:16.610 --> 04:19.820
Urakata, I don't wear panties.

04:20.030 --> 04:22.160
Any underwear will work!

04:22.280 --> 04:23.950
It doesn't seem to bother you...

04:26.200 --> 04:27.210
Well...

04:32.210 --> 04:33.210
Meow.

04:34.210 --> 04:37.720
Avoid spells, in the future!

04:37.970 --> 04:40.760
I will not let you die.

04:40.890 --> 04:43.430
Heal, Kogarashi.

04:45.600 --> 04:47.140
Three at once!

04:48.230 --> 04:50.390
They have burned us with politeness!

04:50.690 --> 04:52.150
If you hadn't stopped me from...

04:52.310 --> 04:53.690
You started it!

04:53.860 --> 04:55.320
Come on, enough arguing!

04:55.650 --> 05:00.070
We have to... Show it on ourselves?

05:00.240 --> 05:01.200
Panties?

05:01.320 --> 05:02.280
Yes.

05:02.620 --> 05:05.660
We tried many other methods, but they didn't work.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.410
I see.

05:07.750 --> 05:08.080
Otherwise...

05:08.250 --> 05:10.210
I can search for a substitute.

05:10.540 --> 05:11.290
No.

05:11.830 --> 05:15.800
It's the occasion to make myself useful.

05:16.630 --> 05:18.920
Too bad if it's that way!

05:19.260 --> 05:23.180
Okay, I'll follow you!
At most, this will be less shameful.

05:23.340 --> 05:26.060
You're right, so, I'm getting in the way.

05:36.320 --> 05:38.690
Here, Kogarashi, panties for you!

05:38.900 --> 05:40.740
Is it okay? Like... this?

05:40.860 --> 05:43.820
Don't look too much.

05:45.370 --> 05:46.950
You too, Koyuzu?

05:47.080 --> 05:50.080
Yeah, I want him to get better!

05:50.250 --> 05:53.750
I suppose it's my turn.

05:54.250 --> 05:55.750
Is this good?

05:58.380 --> 06:00.720
Huh, why is there no flame?

06:00.840 --> 06:02.880
That doesn't work
with boy shorts it seems...

06:03.430 --> 06:06.100
What is this? Good grief!

06:07.720 --> 06:08.970
There you go!

06:13.690 --> 06:14.730
That's it!

06:16.400 --> 06:18.520
Why did he get that stupid spell now?

06:19.070 --> 06:21.900
We're the only ones left!

06:22.110 --> 06:24.740
That's too bad! Let's draw!

06:24.990 --> 06:27.240
Yuna

06:24.990 --> 06:27.240
Chisaki

06:24.990 --> 06:27.240
Hibari

06:24.990 --> 06:27.240
Karura

06:27.240 --> 06:29.790
All right, I'm going.

06:30.620 --> 06:32.250
Courage, Chisaki!

06:37.420 --> 06:39.340
<i>I'm too embarrassed.</i>

06:39.630 --> 06:41.880
<i>Even though he's already seen my panties.</i>

06:42.170 --> 06:44.470
<i>It was always by accident though.</i>

06:48.260 --> 06:49.810
<i>But at last...</i>

06:50.850 --> 06:54.730
<i>He always does too much for me...</i>

06:58.480 --> 07:00.860
<i>I owe him that.</i>

07:07.700 --> 07:10.330
<i>If that can cure him...</i>

07:10.790 --> 07:12.750
<i>I will show it to him as much as it takes!</i>

07:16.750 --> 07:19.590
Here, it's done thanks, Miyazaki!

07:21.210 --> 07:23.460
She just lifted her skirt.

07:24.630 --> 07:29.220
<i>After what I've done to you,
I will do everything to redeem myself.</i>

07:29.800 --> 07:31.470
<i>Not only redeem myself,</i>

07:31.720 --> 07:33.600
<i>but also regain your trust.</i>

07:34.730 --> 07:37.020
<i>I'll show you all...</i>

07:37.560 --> 07:39.020
<i>what I feel for Kogarashi.</i>

07:41.070 --> 07:43.860
Kogarashi must remain lying down.

07:52.870 --> 07:57.120
This is how you treat
his beloved with respect!

07:59.960 --> 08:03.210
You think you're going to beat <i>me</i>?!

08:03.710 --> 08:06.050
Hibari, don't rush without thinking!

08:09.010 --> 08:10.010
<i>I have too...</i>

08:10.140 --> 08:13.310
<i>Convey my feelings...</i>

08:14.350 --> 08:16.020
<i>I love him...</i>

08:17.440 --> 08:18.850
<i>So...</i>

08:19.650 --> 08:21.810
<i>I have to do it...</i>

08:23.860 --> 08:26.360
<i>Me too, I can do it...</i>

08:26.490 --> 08:29.280
Did you undo a knot?

08:29.990 --> 08:33.240
You think we win by being vulgar?

08:33.370 --> 08:35.580
You have to do the same, if you can!

08:35.700 --> 08:38.540
You think it's a good subject for a fight, don't you?

08:41.500 --> 08:44.500
<i>Karura and Hibari are impressive.</i>

08:45.380 --> 08:47.630
<i>How do I go about it?</i>

08:48.170 --> 08:50.550
<i>Which method should I choose...</i>

08:53.390 --> 08:54.640
Yuna...

08:59.350 --> 09:01.400
<i>I was silly.</i>

09:02.150 --> 09:04.400
<i>This is not a contest.</i>

09:05.190 --> 09:08.690
<i>He saved me multiple times.</i>

09:09.990 --> 09:12.740
<i>He's the one who fills me with joy.</i>

09:17.910 --> 09:19.910
<i>What matters...</i>

09:23.460 --> 09:25.540
<i>Is to save Kogarashi.</i>

09:38.600 --> 09:40.230
You don't have any panties!

09:40.390 --> 09:42.940
You pervert!

09:43.230 --> 09:45.190
I didn't mean to!

09:45.310 --> 09:49.490
I was mistaken in
metamorphosing to change...

09:49.610 --> 09:53.030
I'm not lying!

09:56.280 --> 09:58.120
The mark has disappeared!

09:59.160 --> 10:01.040
What a relief!

10:05.670 --> 10:08.130
No, wait! It's weird!

10:13.840 --> 10:14.840
Damn it.

10:15.300 --> 10:18.350
This time, you have
to show him your bras!

10:19.100 --> 10:24.270
<i>They didn't know yet what the next spell would require...</i>

10:27.190 --> 10:31.940
<i>To show themselves naked.</i>

10:38.280 --> 10:42.540
Last Minute!? Hot Spring Happening!

10:39.200 --> 10:42.660
We're back! Welcome back home!

10:43.160 --> 10:45.330
You bring us back a lot!

10:45.460 --> 10:47.460
It's to prepare dinner.

10:48.130 --> 10:50.460
Thank you for the invitation.

10:50.630 --> 10:51.880
Thank you!

10:52.130 --> 10:54.050
We met in town.

10:54.170 --> 10:57.050
Then we did the shopping together.

10:57.260 --> 10:59.350
That goes without saying.

10:59.680 --> 11:00.350
Thanks.

11:01.180 --> 11:03.230
Alright, I'll bring them in the kitchen.

11:03.430 --> 11:05.850
Thank you too, Ms..

11:08.110 --> 11:09.610
<i>Fuyuzora...</i>

11:11.480 --> 11:14.360
<i>I'm a succubus,</i>

11:14.610 --> 11:16.610
<i>but I want a normal life.</i>

11:17.570 --> 11:20.200
A real gentleman, this Kogarashi.

11:20.910 --> 11:23.000
Yes.

11:23.870 --> 11:25.000
Here you go.

11:25.210 --> 11:27.750
You can go wash yourself.

11:28.580 --> 11:31.300
You really want to do it?

11:32.050 --> 11:34.720
And if you join us?

11:35.510 --> 11:37.090
No, I can't do that...

11:37.470 --> 11:39.970
Don't worry, I'll put towel on us.

11:40.470 --> 11:41.600
<i>What a pest!</i>

11:41.890 --> 11:44.390
<i>Stop annoying him!</i>

11:45.350 --> 11:47.100
<i>I wanted to bathe with him...</i>

11:47.310 --> 11:50.900
No, I refuse. Today, it's
your turn, you deserve it.

11:52.190 --> 11:53.440
<i>It's a lost cause.</i>

11:54.440 --> 11:56.530
Then I'll tell the others:

11:56.700 --> 11:59.320
"Kogarashi doesn't want to come."

11:59.660 --> 12:02.030
Come on, agree!

12:02.990 --> 12:04.870
Well, in that case...

12:05.870 --> 12:07.370
<i>Great!</i>

12:15.010 --> 12:18.090
Aw, I'm tired of it!

12:18.220 --> 12:21.390
It's you that wanted that
I carry you on my shoulders!

12:21.760 --> 12:24.970
And you, you wanted to
reach stuff that was too high!

12:27.600 --> 12:28.810
What's this?

12:30.480 --> 12:31.520
Tada!

12:31.770 --> 12:33.690
Look what we found on the reserve!

12:33.820 --> 12:35.530
Bath salt!

12:35.820 --> 12:39.740
On the reserve? The boss's one?

12:40.280 --> 12:43.240
<i>One of the boss's treasures,</i>

12:43.370 --> 12:46.830
<i>Known to have caused
numerous problems in the past.</i>

12:47.540 --> 12:50.960
Those bath salts surely aren't ordinary.

12:51.080 --> 12:54.130
Yeah, we'd better not use them.

12:54.380 --> 12:59.300
This box changes the psychic
energy of it's user into bath salt!

12:59.510 --> 13:02.470
Given the source size, it'll put a lot!

13:02.800 --> 13:04.510
She didn't even listen!

13:05.010 --> 13:07.310
Everything is ready for the dinner.

13:07.430 --> 13:10.020
And can we join the others in the bath?

13:10.140 --> 13:11.060
Okay!

13:11.310 --> 13:15.650
But are you sure that I'm welcome to?

13:15.820 --> 13:19.110
Yes, we'll put on our towels.

13:19.280 --> 13:21.570
And the girls are all here for you.

13:27.080 --> 13:29.160
The water is pink?

13:29.580 --> 13:30.790
Nakai!

13:31.040 --> 13:33.540
It's super good!

13:36.420 --> 13:38.760
It's true that it's nice.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.670
How did you do it?

13:40.800 --> 13:43.800
Koyuzu and Miria found bath salt

13:44.090 --> 13:45.600
in the boss's reserve.

13:47.350 --> 13:49.480
Is everybody ok?

13:50.270 --> 13:53.310
Nothing strange happened.

13:53.560 --> 13:55.650
They're just in some bath salt.

13:56.190 --> 13:59.030
No! I think that...

14:00.320 --> 14:01.490
I'm coming in!

14:02.450 --> 14:03.490
You can't!

14:44.320 --> 14:47.530
Come on, get over here!

14:49.580 --> 14:50.620
Yes?

14:52.370 --> 14:54.330
It seems it's too late...

14:54.460 --> 14:56.670
These bath salts possess

14:57.130 --> 14:59.630
a powerful aphrodisiac effect,

15:00.170 --> 15:03.170
that annihilates all will!

15:04.380 --> 15:06.550
Get.. Get away.

15:07.140 --> 15:09.350
They bathed in here for too long.

15:09.760 --> 15:12.430
It is no longer possible  to reason with them.

15:21.400 --> 15:24.070
Welcome to my room, Fuyuzora.

15:24.440 --> 15:26.410
She's very Spartan.

15:28.370 --> 15:32.080
But tonight, you'll be able to play with me.

15:32.580 --> 15:35.250
This sensation...
It's been a long time, Oboro.

15:40.090 --> 15:43.380
I'll send Oboro in the underground jail.

15:43.760 --> 15:44.760
Hiogi?

15:44.880 --> 15:48.090
Behind an impassable magic barrier.

15:50.640 --> 15:53.350
<i>My body no longer obeys me!</i>

15:54.890 --> 15:57.100
Don't be afraid, Kogarashi.

15:57.310 --> 15:59.350
I'm going to take it slow.

15:59.610 --> 16:01.520
What the hell is happening!

16:04.400 --> 16:05.610
Where am I?

16:08.200 --> 16:11.120
My power of appearance doesn't work anymore?

16:11.240 --> 16:13.040
Is this another dimension?

16:13.990 --> 16:17.160
This kind of spell...
It's the power of a Tenko!

16:17.410 --> 16:19.670
Devilish Yuna!

16:22.340 --> 16:24.050
Uh, Kogarashi...

16:25.630 --> 16:26.840
Today...

16:27.800 --> 16:29.590
We can do it with our eyes open.

16:31.720 --> 16:32.720
<i>Damn it!</i>

16:33.140 --> 16:36.390
<i>I'm still paralysed by Hiogi's spell!</i>

16:36.680 --> 16:37.680
<i>Move!</i>

16:39.390 --> 16:40.440
Yuna...

16:40.770 --> 16:43.440
Fight against this aphrodisiac!

16:44.270 --> 16:47.690
<i>Kogarashi make me discover new things.</i>

16:50.070 --> 16:52.910
<i>He's the first that
offered me a birthday gift.</i>

16:53.700 --> 16:57.250
<i>He's the first who I've felt happy with.</i>

16:58.620 --> 17:01.790
I would like to offer you my first time.

17:09.090 --> 17:10.470
Yuna...

17:13.010 --> 17:17.720
Now, I'm too ashamed!

17:18.680 --> 17:20.060
Here's my chance!

17:21.350 --> 17:25.400
I'm sorry! Kogarashi disappeared?!

17:29.570 --> 17:31.820
Thanks, cat-god.

17:34.530 --> 17:37.330
They all went looking for Fuyuzora.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.500
But won't everybody see us here?

17:39.870 --> 17:43.460
No, the cat-god makes us invisible.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.710
Say, Fuyuzora.

17:46.340 --> 17:47.420
Open your eyes.

17:47.630 --> 17:50.550
Miyazaki? I refuse to watch!

17:50.920 --> 17:54.680
If it's you, I'm willing.

17:55.140 --> 17:58.600
I agree with Chisaki.

17:58.810 --> 18:02.190
I don't know why, but I feel weird...

18:02.730 --> 18:05.150
I can't take it anymore.

18:05.230 --> 18:06.020
Yaya?

18:06.020 --> 18:08.320
Don't double cross us!

18:08.940 --> 18:09.900
Kogarashi.

18:10.240 --> 18:11.280
Nii-san.

18:12.360 --> 18:14.160
Come to your senses!

18:14.570 --> 18:17.910
Where are you, Kogarashi?

18:18.040 --> 18:18.450
Yuna!

18:18.910 --> 18:20.830
He's here, Yumesaki-sensei!

18:23.040 --> 18:24.120
Too bad for you!

18:24.250 --> 18:26.130
With my telepathy,

18:26.250 --> 18:29.250
I can spot you even if you're invisible!

18:32.590 --> 18:36.800
I did it! They're all dreaming of Fuyuzora!

18:36.930 --> 18:41.640
Well done!
Use your succubus power!

18:44.060 --> 18:45.060
Wake up.

18:48.650 --> 18:50.980
Is it not too strong?

18:51.110 --> 18:54.780
So, you like big breasts don't you?

18:54.990 --> 18:57.490
We've got big ones!

18:59.990 --> 19:01.330
A teleportation spell!

19:02.950 --> 19:04.620
Sagiri and Hibari!

19:05.540 --> 19:07.830
Answer, Fuyuzora Kogarashi!

19:11.460 --> 19:14.380
This size fits you too, right?

19:15.430 --> 19:18.760
They don't have to be huge, do they?

19:19.760 --> 19:21.390
Not especially!

19:25.060 --> 19:27.020
Oh no! A metamorphosis spell!

19:27.900 --> 19:30.230
They changed us into dolls!

19:30.400 --> 19:32.280
Impossible to cast such a spell!

19:32.400 --> 19:36.570
Wait, why does only yours have a chest?

19:36.860 --> 19:38.280
Koyuzu and Miria!

19:38.530 --> 19:41.620
Explain to us, Kogarashi.

19:42.870 --> 19:44.750
What is...

19:45.250 --> 19:47.040
This weird sensation?

19:47.370 --> 19:51.340
My heart is beating so fast!

19:52.000 --> 19:55.260
I've never felt like this...

19:55.840 --> 19:57.050
You too?

19:58.510 --> 20:01.510
Wha... What's going on with you?

20:07.890 --> 20:09.100
<i>Oh no!</i>

20:09.310 --> 20:13.400
<i>If a boy and a girl bathe at the same time, then...</i>

20:20.240 --> 20:22.030
Kogarashi...

20:29.040 --> 20:33.380
You really think I'm too old for you...?

20:34.170 --> 20:35.420
Nakai!

20:37.010 --> 20:38.590
No, no, no!

20:38.880 --> 20:40.760
And me, Kogarashi!

20:40.800 --> 20:43.680
And me!

20:44.510 --> 20:50.020
Stop it, Koyozu! Don't do it, Miria!

20:52.520 --> 20:54.860
<i>Thanks to the strong will of Kogarashi,</i>

20:54.980 --> 20:59.320
<i>this crazy night had no consequences.</i>

20:59.910 --> 21:04.030
<i>But this memory bothered him for a while,</i>

21:04.240 --> 21:07.750
<i>even in the boarders, in the evening at bedtime.</i>

23:00.190 --> 23:02.690
Sorry, I did it again.

23:02.820 --> 23:05.110
Ah yes, it's the powers of Tenko.

23:05.240 --> 23:08.700
It's great that you can control your power.

23:09.030 --> 23:12.950
It should be possible to break
the seal that encloses your memory.

23:13.200 --> 23:15.120
And you will know
what keeps you on earth!

23:19.000 --> 23:20.210
Kogarashi...

23:21.000 --> 23:22.010
For me...

23:23.760 --> 23:28.180
It's still too early.

23:31.180 --> 23:33.310
To be honest...

23:34.390 --> 23:39.060
I would like to live forever
in the company of you all!

23:42.570 --> 23:43.650
Sorry.

23:43.990 --> 23:48.530
I was convinced that for a ghost, it was the best solution.

23:48.990 --> 23:49.990
No...

23:50.240 --> 23:53.910
I was the one who didn't dare to tell you about it.

23:54.660 --> 23:55.660
No worries.

23:58.080 --> 23:59.290
In fact,

24:00.090 --> 24:01.670
it's a relief.

24:06.170 --> 24:09.050
We're all with you,

24:09.640 --> 24:10.470
so you'll be fine!

24:11.600 --> 24:12.600
I hope so.

24:13.060 --> 24:14.140
Kogarashi.

24:27.820 --> 24:32.030
In spite of my faults, I rely on you.
